T1  - Borderline resectable pancreatic cancer: the importance of this emerging stage of disease.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jamcollsurg.2007.12.020
A1  - Katz, Matthew H G
A1  - Pisters, Peter W T
A1  - Evans, Douglas B
