T1  - Serum REG4 level is a predictive biomarker for the response to preoperative chemoradiotherapy in patients with pancreatic cancer.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1097/MPA.0b013e3181ac5337
A1  - Eguchi, Hidetoshi
A1  - Ishikawa, Osamu
A1  - Ohigashi, Hiroaki
A1  - Takahashi, Hidenori
A1  - Yano, Masahiko
