T1  - Pancreatic tumor motion on a single planning 4D-CT does not correlate with intrafraction tumor motion during treatment.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1097/COC.0b013e31818da9e0
A1  - Minn, A Yuriko
A1  - Schellenberg, Devin
A1  - Maxim, Peter
