T1  - Neoadjuvant chemoradiation in patients with potentially resectable pancreatic cancer.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1097/mpa.0b013e31814b229a
A1  - Takai, Soichiro
A1  - Satoi, Sohei
A1  - Yanagimoto, Hiroaki
A1  - Toyokawa, Hideyoshi
A1  - Takahashi, Kanji
