A1  - Khan, A Z
A1  - Pitsinis, V
A1  - Mudan, S S
Y1  - 2007//
N2  - Pancreatic cancer is an aggressive malignancy, relatively resistant to chemotherapy and radiotherapy, which usually presents late. Disease specific mortality approaches unity despite advances in adjuvant therapy. We present the first reported case of complete pathological response following neoadjuvant therapy in a locally advanced pancreatic adenocarcinoma.
