T1  - Angiotensin-II administration is useful for the detection of liver metastasis from pancreatic cancer during pharmacoangiographic computed tomography.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3748/wjg.v13.i22.3080
A1  - Ishikawa, Toru
A1  - Ushiki, Takashi
A1  - Kamimura, Hiroteru
A1  - Togashi, Tadayuki
A1  - Tsuchiya, Atsunori
