T1  - A phase I study of eniluracil/5-FU in combination with radiation therapy for potentially resectable and/or unresectable cancer of the pancreas and distal biliary tract.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/07357900500449454
A1  - Czito, Brian G
