T1  - Docetaxel/Gemcitabine followed by gemcitabine and external beam radiotherapy in patients with pancreatic adenocarcinoma.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1245/ASO.2005.04.503
A1  - Pipas, J Marc
A1  - Barth, Richard J Jr
A1  - Zaki, Bassem
A1  - Tsapakos, Michael J
A1  - Suriawinata, Arief A
