T1  - Significance of histological response to preoperative chemoradiotherapy for pancreatic cancer.
T3  - Comment in: Ann Surg Oncol. 2005 Mar;12(3):200-1<ovid:br/> PMID: 15827809 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/15827809]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1245/ASO.2005.03.105
A1  - White, Rebekah R
A1  - Xie, H Bill
A1  - Gottfried, Marcia R
A1  - Czito, Brian G
A1  - Hurwitz, Herbert I
