T1  - [Adjuvant chemotherapy for unresectable locally advanced pancreatic cancer in light of its characteristics].
A1  - Taoka, Hiroki
A1  - Hirano, Hitomi
A1  - Mitsui, Yasushi
A1  - Umino, Wataru
A1  - Nobuoka, Yu
A1  - Yamashita, Masako
