N2  - A total of 44 patients with lung carcinoma underwent combined treatment involving systemic enzyme therapy with Wobe-Mugos E. In conducting radio- and polychemotherapy, the above enzyme therapy did not complicate the postoperative course, with the pyo-septic complications having gotten reduced, the origination of pneumofibroses prevented.
