T1  - [A case report of preoperative intra-arterial infusion chemotherapy for pancreatic head carcinoma].
A1  - Ohigashi, H
A1  - Ishikawa, O
A1  - Sasaki, Y
A1  - Nakano, H
A1  - Nakamori, S
