T1  - [Malignant non-epithelial tumors of the pancreas].
T2  - Maligne nichtepitheliale Tumoren des Pankreas.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s002920050211
A1  - Luttges, J
A1  - Pierre, E
